From d634cca3236de1b2548d4b9a79bba2b311f847fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Bokovoy <abokovoy@redhat.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:58:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] aci: regenerate ACI.txt for the permission changes

makeaci --validate (acilint) output for the managed-permission changes:
ipaNTSecurityIdentifier moved to authenticated read (dropped from the
anonymous "System: Read User Standard Attributes" and "System: Read
Groups", added to "System: Read User IPA Attributes" and the new
"System: Read Group SID"), and the protected-group / ipaservers target
filters added to the delegated user, group and host write permissions.

Fixes: CVE-2026-76578
Signed-off-by: Alexander Bokovoy <abokovoy@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit 512e4cd567f881952425d0abb083be19d0a8be44)
---
 ACI.txt | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------------
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

